    {
      "id": "jVW-NVM9-tGMbSjXimv_c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 278,
      "y": 1358,
      "width": 634,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1169116658,
      "version": 896,
      "versionNonce": 436067950,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788938506800,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nJava has very strict rule regarding multiple catch\n============================================\n\nRule 1 : \n-----------\n--> parent class of exception hierarchy cannot come before\nchild.\n\n--> Because parent class ref can always point to child class\nobject and thus child class catch will never run . \n\n--> Thus compiler does not compile the code and give error\n\"unreachable code .\"\n\nRule 2 : \n-----------\n\nIf a variable is being used bellow try catch block then it must\ncompulsorily initialized before try .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nJava has very strict rule regarding multiple catch\n============================================\n\nRule 1 : \n-----------\n--> parent class of exception hierarchy cannot come before child.\n\n--> Because parent class ref can always point to child class object and thus child class catch will never run . \n\n--> Thus compiler does not compile the code and give error \"unreachable code .\"\n\nRule 2 : \n-----------\n\nIf a variable is being used bellow try catch block then it must compulsorily initialized before try .",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
